{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"function-flexrender","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Function: flexRender()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function flexRender<TProps>(Comp, props): unknown;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/octane-table/src/FlexRender.ts#L24","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FlexRender.ts:24"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If rendering headers, cells, or footers with custom markup, use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"flexRender"},{"type":"text","value":"\ninstead of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cell.getValue()"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cell.renderValue()"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tprops","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TProps"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TProps"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"object"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"comp","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Comp"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/Renderable.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Renderable"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TProps"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"props","children":[{"type":"text","value":"props"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TProps"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"flexRender(cell.column.columnDef.cell, cell.getContext())\n\nPort note: upstream additionally detects class components and\n`react.memo`/`react.forward_ref` exotic objects. Both branches are dead in\noctane — there are no class components or `forwardRef`, and octane's `memo()`\nreturns a plain function — so a component is exactly `typeof === 'function'`.\nThe descriptor `createElement` returns renders at value position; non-component\nvalues (strings, numbers, pre-created descriptors) pass through as-is.","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"function-flexrender","text":"Function: flexRender()","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tprops","text":"TProps","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"comp","text":"Comp","level":3},{"id":"props","text":"props","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Function: flexRender()\n\n```ts\nfunction flexRender<TProps>(Comp, props): unknown;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FlexRender.ts:24](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/octane-table/src/FlexRender.ts#L24)\n\nIf rendering headers, cells, or footers with custom markup, use `flexRender`\ninstead of `cell.getValue()` or `cell.renderValue()`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TProps\n\n`TProps` *extends* `object`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### Comp\n\n[`Renderable`](../type-aliases/Renderable.md)\\<`TProps`\\>\n\n### props\n\n`TProps`\n\n## Returns\n\n`unknown`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nflexRender(cell.column.columnDef.cell, cell.getContext())\n\nPort note: upstream additionally detects class components and\n`react.memo`/`react.forward_ref` exotic objects. Both branches are dead in\noctane — there are no class components or `forwardRef`, and octane's `memo()`\nreturns a plain function — so a component is exactly `typeof === 'function'`.\nThe descriptor `createElement` returns renders at value position; non-component\nvalues (strings, numbers, pre-created descriptors) pass through as-is.\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: flexRender\ntitle: flexRender\n---\n\n# Function: flexRender()\n\n```ts\nfunction flexRender<TProps>(Comp, props): unknown;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FlexRender.ts:24](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/octane-table/src/FlexRender.ts#L24)\n\nIf rendering headers, cells, or footers with custom markup, use `flexRender`\ninstead of `cell.getValue()` or `cell.renderValue()`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TProps\n\n`TProps` *extends* `object`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### Comp\n\n[`Renderable`](../type-aliases/Renderable.md)\\<`TProps`\\>\n\n### props\n\n`TProps`\n\n## Returns\n\n`unknown`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nflexRender(cell.column.columnDef.cell, cell.getContext())\n\nPort note: upstream additionally detects class components and\n`react.memo`/`react.forward_ref` exotic objects. Both branches are dead in\noctane — there are no class components or `forwardRef`, and octane's `memo()`\nreturns a plain function — so a component is exactly `typeof === 'function'`.\nThe descriptor `createElement` returns renders at value position; non-component\nvalues (strings, numbers, pre-created descriptors) pass through as-is.\n```\n"}
